-
-> Self-contained specification for AI coding agents working on the EcoGreen repository.
-> Stack (fixed): **React 19 + Vite + React Router (JavaScript/JSX)** · **Spring Boot 4.0.x, Java 21, Maven** · **PostgreSQL**.
