+and one specification per remaining module. It replaces the former `00_GAP_ANALYSIS.md`, `02_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md`,
+`03_AGENT_PROMPTS.md` (V1) and `03_AGENT_PROMPTS_V2.md`.
 
